-没错，太对了！
-然后自己开着
大马力肌肉车回家。
-Yeah, exactly!
-And then drive home
in a big muscle car.

523
00:28:07,720 --> 00:28:09,480
-比如开GTO，对。
-开你的大肌肉车。
-Here, GTO. Yeah.
-Your big muscle car.

524
00:28:09,520 --> 00:28:11,640
一点没错。
Exactly.

525
00:28:11,680 --> 00:28:13,400
因为你还真经历过一次
正儿八经的警匪追逐，
对吧？
'Cause you have actually been
in a proper police chase,
haven't you?

526
00:28:13,440 --> 00:28:17,080
对，没错，是的。
那是1989年，我……
Yes, yes, yes.
Back in '89, I...

527
00:28:17,120 --> 00:28:19,400
我去了一家夜店，
贪杯多喝了几杯，
I did go to a club,
had a couple too many,

528
00:28:19,440 --> 00:28:21,480
结果警察想靠边拦我，
我当时心想……
and the cops
wanted to pull me over,
and I was like...

529
00:28:21,520 --> 00:28:24,360
呃，那年正好是
《蝙蝠侠》上映的那一年。
Well, it was also the year
that Batmanhad come out.

530
00:28:24,400 --> 00:28:26,240
所以……
我当时就有点……
So...
I just sort of...

531
00:28:26,280 --> 00:28:29,360
有那么一瞬间
产生了我就是蝙蝠侠的
幻觉。
I had a delusion
that I was Batman
for a moment.

532
00:28:29,400 --> 00:28:33,840
然后油门一脚踩到底，
不过那场追逐
并没持续多久。
And just put the pedal
to the metal, and it wasn't
a very long chase.

533
00:28:33,880 --> 00:28:36,680
其实算不上……有点
既可悲又窝囊，不过……
It wasn't... It was kind of
sad and pathetic, but...

534
00:28:36,720 --> 00:28:38,680
-他们最终……
-最后怎么收场的？
-They eventually...
-How did it end?

535
00:28:38,720 --> 00:28:40,240
结局嘛，呃，皆大欢喜。
It ended, uh, happily.

536
00:28:40,280 --> 00:28:42,600
我们热情相拥，
然后他们就放我各奔前程了。
We all hugged and embraced,
and they sent me on my way.

537
00:28:42,640 --> 00:28:45,200
-[观众笑声]
-通常都是这套路，
对吧？是啊。
-[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]
-That's usually how it goes,
isn't it? Yeah.

538
00:28:45,240 --> 00:28:47,640
不过这倒挺有意思的。
因为美国警察
可从来不拥抱我，
That's funny, though.
Because American policeman
don't embrace me

539
00:28:47,680 --> 00:28:49,400
每当他们
抓到我超速的时候。
when they
catch me speeding.

540
00:28:49,440 --> 00:28:52,200
-他们不抱你啊？
-他们大喊大叫，
而且直接掏枪。
-They don't, huh?
-They shout and scream
and pull guns out.

541
00:28:52,240 --> 00:28:54,840
呃，关键在于，
美国有一些，你知道的……
Well, the point is,
there's certain, you know...

542
00:28:54,880 --> 00:28:58,520
在美国，
你可以去参加警察慈善舞会。
In America,
there's a Policemen's Ball
you can go to.

543
00:28:58,560 --> 00:29:00,600
你有很多门路
可以去“投资”，
There's a lot of ways
you can invest

544
00:29:00,640 --> 00:29:03,480
去搞点慈善捐款，
and you make
charitable contributions,

545
00:29:03,520 --> 00:29:05,720
这样万一碰上这类倒霉事，
so that when something
like that does occur,

546
00:29:05,760 --> 00:29:08,880
他们就会客气得多，
也宽容得多。
they are much more gracious
and much more receptive.

547
00:29:08,920 --> 00:29:11,320
其实我更喜欢
直接坐飞机回国。
I prefer to just
fly home, actually.

548
00:29:11,360 --> 00:29:14,040
-直接飞回家，对。
-我在内华达吃了16张超速罚单。
-Fly home, yeah.
-Sixteen speeding tickets
in Nevada.

549
00:29:14,080 --> 00:29:15,640
一张都没交。
我拍拍屁股直接回英国了。
All unpaid.
I've just come home.

550
00:29:15,680 --> 00:29:17,040
-我的天呐。
-[观众笑声]
-Oh, my God.
-[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

551
00:29:17,080 --> 00:29:18,200
-太绝了。
-就该这么干。
-That's fantastic.
-That's the way to go.

552
00:29:18,240 --> 00:29:20,680
“你必须在三天之内缴清！”
You've gotta pay this
within three days!"

553
00:29:20,720 --> 00:29:23,840
可不是嘛！“回见您嘞！”
Exactly! "See ya!"

554
00:29:23,880 --> 00:29:26,440
我不得不说，
你的用车履历挺有意思的。
Your car history's
quite interesting,
I have to say.

555
00:29:26,480 --> 00:29:29,280
因为你开过……
曾经买过一辆日产探路者，
Because we've had...
There's been
a Nissan Pathfinder

556
00:29:29,320 --> 00:29:31,040
-还有一辆沃尔沃。
-对。
-and a Volvo.
-Yeah.

557
00:29:31,080 --> 00:29:33,400
坦白讲，这配置
会让你显得像个无聊透顶的人。
Which would
set you up as
a bit of a bore, frankly.

558
00:29:33,440 --> 00:29:38,160
呃，那辆沃尔沃嘛，
纯粹是为了掩人耳目。
Well, the Volvo was, uh,
really for covert purposes.

559
00:29:38,200 --> 00:29:40,560
呃，我是说，
根本没人会多看一眼沃尔沃，你懂的。
Uh, I mean,
nobody looks at a Volvo,
you know.

560
00:29:40,600 --> 00:29:42,120
这倒是一句大实话。
Well, that's true.

561
00:29:42,160 --> 00:29:44,360
沃尔沃很低调，
属于那种
特别不起眼的车型。
Volvo's are very subtle,
very kind of
inconspicuous vehicles.

562
00:29:44,400 --> 00:29:46,800
无聊透顶！那你后来干嘛
买了台保时捷 Carrera？
Dull! So, why did you get
a Porsche Carrera, then?

563
00:29:46,840 --> 00:29:49,280
因为我不想再那么低调了。
'Cause I didn't want to be
inconspicuous any more.

564
00:29:49,320 --> 00:29:51,480
懂了。那你见过
哈蒙德的新车吗？
I see. Have you seen
Hammond's new car?

565
00:29:51,520 --> 00:29:54,280
-啊，见过了。我还看他在车旁摆姿势装酷呢，没错。
-他的挑战者。
-Ah, yes. I saw him posing
next to it. Yeah.
-His Challenger.

566
00:29:54,320 --> 00:29:57,160
-你觉得那车如何？
-我觉得……
颜色挺漂亮的。
-What do you think of that?
-I think
it's a beautiful colour.

567
00:29:57,200 --> 00:29:58,600
-那是一台……
-[全场大笑]
-It's a...
-[ALL LAUGHING]

568
00:30:00,920 --> 00:30:04,400
呃，我以为你们美国
已经没有 SUV 了呢，
不是都被禁了吗？
Um, I thought you don't
have SUVs over in America,
isn't it? They've been banned.

569
00:30:04,440 --> 00:30:07,440
哎，话是这么说。
但要是有了家室，
Well, yeah.
I mean, when you do
tend to have a family,

570
00:30:07,480 --> 00:30:11,720
要么买辆 MPV，要么买辆 SUV，
比如凯雷德那种大块头。
either you do get
a minivan or an SUV,
some kind of Escalade.

571
00:30:11,760 --> 00:30:14,640
我们确实开过一阵子凯雷德。
And we did go for the
Escalade for a little while.

572
00:30:14,680 --> 00:30:17,280
-你开过那台凯迪拉克巨无霸？
-对，开过那台大凯迪拉克，
-You've done the big Cadillac?
-Yeah, we've done
the big Cadillac,

573
00:30:17,320 --> 00:30:21,000
然后……你懂的，
心里开始觉得特别过意不去。
and felt, you know,
started to feel very
guilty about that.

574
00:30:21,040 --> 00:30:22,720
所以现在，
我们也把它给处理掉了。
And so now,
we've let that go as well.

575
00:30:22,760 --> 00:30:24,600
因为在如今的美国……
比如旧金山，
'Cause in America,
you've now got...
San Francisco,

576
00:30:24,640 --> 00:30:27,480
他们不是刚在市中心
禁了 SUV 吗……
haven't they just banned
SUVs from the central...

577
00:30:27,520 --> 00:30:29,760
好像是的，没错。
Think so. Yeah.

578
00:30:29,800 --> 00:30:31,440
据说是车重太夸张，
把柏油路面都压裂了。对。
They were supposedly
are so heavy that they were
cracking the roads. Yeah.

579
00:30:31,480 --> 00:30:33,360
限重好像是 2.7 吨。
2.7 tonnes
I think is the limit.

580
00:30:33,400 --> 00:30:35,040
超过这个重量就不许……
You're not allowed
to have one over...

581
00:30:35,080 --> 00:30:37,440
但旧金山大部分行人都比这重吧！
But most pedestrians
weigh that much
in San Francisco.

582
00:30:37,480 --> 00:30:38,560
[全场大笑]
[ALL LAUGHING]

583
00:30:40,000 --> 00:30:42,560
“小心把圣安德烈斯断层
给震塌了！”
"You'll set the
San Andreas Fault off!"

584
00:30:42,600 --> 00:30:43,600
“减减肥吧！”
"Go on a diet."

585
00:30:43,640 --> 00:30:45,440
“别吃芝士了！”
"Don't eat cheese!"

586
00:30:45,480 --> 00:30:48,600
言归正传，赛道上跑得如何？
Anyhow, how was it
out there on the track?

587
00:30:48,640 --> 00:30:51,080
呃，在赛道上嘛，
首先，斯提格简直是个天才。
Uh, out there on the track,
first of all,
the Stig was genius.

588
00:30:51,120 --> 00:30:54,640
我是说，他简直绝了。
非常棒的教练。
I mean,
he was absolutely brilliant.
A great coach.

589
00:30:54,680 --> 00:30:58,520
过第一个弯的时候，
我有几次……
跑得相当挣扎。
I had a few...
Few rough goes
around the first turn.

590
00:30:58,560 --> 00:31:00,840
我觉得跑得有点糙，
但我挺享受的。
I think that was little rough.
But I enjoyed it.

591
00:31:00,880 --> 00:31:02,280
咱们来看看录像？
Shall we have a look?

592
00:31:02,320 --> 00:31:03,720
众人：好啊！
ALL: Yes.

593
00:31:03,760 --> 00:31:05,520
-行，放录像吧。
惨不忍睹，走起！
-Okay. Let's play the tape.
It's sad, here we go.

594
00:31:05,560 --> 00:31:07,160
[轮胎尖叫声]
[TYRES SCREECHING]

595
00:31:07,200 --> 00:31:08,400
克拉克森：噢，
瞧瞧，这起步相当利落啊。
CLARKSON: Ooh,
now you see that's
an impressive start.

596
00:31:08,440 --> 00:31:10,120
-起步漂亮。
-开局还真不赖。
-That's a good start.
-That's not a bad start.

597
00:31:12,080 --> 00:31:13,280
克拉克森：然后这是第一个弯。
CLARKSON: And that's
the first corner.

598
00:31:13,320 --> 00:31:15,560
克里斯蒂安：哇！
快看！
手都脱把了！
CHRISTIAN: Whoa!
Look at that!
Off the wheel!

599
00:31:15,600 --> 00:31:16,920
这[哔——]太快了！
It's too [BEEP] fast!

600
00:31:16,960 --> 00:31:18,560
[观众大笑]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

601
00:31:18,600 --> 00:31:20,280
克里斯蒂安：而且这车
根本跑不快。
CHRISTIAN: And the car's
not going fast enough.

602
00:31:20,320 --> 00:31:22,120
当时真让我抓狂。
I was really frustrated
with that.

603
00:31:22,160 --> 00:31:24,240
是啊，你切进这几个弯时
真够凶狠的。
Yeah, you are
driving into these corners
really aggressively.

604
00:31:24,280 --> 00:31:25,920
我确实豁出去了，对吧？
I'm really taking 'em,
aren't I?

605
00:31:25,960 --> 00:31:28,360
伙计，平时哪有机会
能这么狠造车啊？
How often do you get
to do something
like this, buddy?

606
00:31:28,400 --> 00:31:29,480
确实不多见！
Not often!

607
00:31:29,520 --> 00:31:30,440
[全场大笑]
[ALL LAUGHING]

608
00:31:31,600 --> 00:31:32,960
[轮胎尖叫声]
[TYRE SCREECHING]

609
00:31:33,000 --> 00:31:35,400
克拉克森：你切那个弯抄近道，
我们就不追究了。
CLARKSON: We'll let you off
cutting that corner.

610
00:31:35,440 --> 00:31:38,080
-毕竟你坐的是车上“正确”的一侧。
-是啊。
-Since you are on
the proper side of the car.
-Yeah.

611
00:31:38,120 --> 00:31:40,360
轻松自如，悠哉游哉。
Nice and easy. Casual.

612
00:31:40,400 --> 00:31:43,040
我知道自己在往哪儿开，
所以稳得很。
I know where I'm going,
so it's all right.

613
00:31:43,080 --> 00:31:45,560
克拉克森：瞧瞧这个，
时速76英里切进弯道。
CLARKSON: Look at this,
76 miles an hour,
going in there.

614
00:31:45,600 --> 00:31:47,640
你过那儿收油了吗？
还是一直踩着油门？
Did you lift off
through there?
Keep your foot on it?

615
00:31:47,680 --> 00:31:49,160
克里斯蒂安：
我油门一直踩到底没松。
噢，爽翻了！
CHRISTIAN:
I kept my foot on it.
Oh, yeah!

616
00:31:50,320 --> 00:31:52,160
嗖的一下！瞧瞧那一下！哇哦。
Zoom! Look at that! Wow.

617
00:31:52,200 --> 00:31:54,160
克拉克森：现在这里重刹。
来到倒数第二个弯了。
CLARKSON: Now braking here.
We're at the
second to last corner.

618
00:31:54,200 --> 00:31:57,240
哟，后轮又腾空了！
讲真，其实跑得挺不赖。
Oh, back wheel
off the ground again!
That is not bad, actually.

619
00:31:57,280 --> 00:31:58,440
克里斯蒂安：瞧瞧这个。
速度终于提上来了。
CHRISTIAN: Oh, look at that.
Now we're goin'.

620
00:31:58,480 --> 00:32:00,400
克拉克森：我喜欢这个过弯走线。
CLARKSON: And I like that
line through there.

621
00:32:00,440 --> 00:32:02,480
标准的迈克尔·甘本线！
冲过终点线了！
The Michael Gambon line!
And they we are,
across the line!

622
00:32:02,520 --> 00:32:04,040
[全场鼓掌]
[ALL APPLAUDING]

623
00:32:04,680 --> 00:32:05,920
干得漂亮！
Well done!

624
00:32:05,960 --> 00:32:07,560
多谢你们把我衬托得这么帅。
Thank you
for making me look good.

625
00:32:07,600 --> 00:32:09,120
真棒！
Well done!

626
00:32:09,920 --> 00:32:11,280
多亏了斯提格。
To the Stig.

627
00:32:11,320 --> 00:32:14,320
那么，你觉得自己能排到哪儿？
Now, then, where do you
think you've done?

628
00:32:14,360 --> 00:32:16,920
希望能排在哈里·恩菲尔德前面。
那可是我的……
Hopefully,
above Harry Enfield.
That was my...

629
00:32:16,960 --> 00:32:19,960
等等，对啊你看，
你刚才后轮都离地了。
Wait. Yeah, look,
you had the back wheel
off the ground.

630
00:32:20,000 --> 00:32:21,440
这水平挺牛的，对吧？
That's pretty good, right?

631
00:32:21,480 --> 00:32:23,560
你是《星际迷航》的大铁粉，对吧？
You're a big Star Trekfan,
aren't you?

632
00:32:23,600 --> 00:32:24,880
那帕特里克排在哪儿？
Well, where's Patrick?

633
00:32:24,920 --> 00:32:27,600
帕特里克·斯图尔特在那儿，
成绩是1分50秒。
Patrick Stewart
is there, at 1.50.

634
00:32:27,640 --> 00:32:29,120
哇！他跑得相当可以啊。
Whoa! He did really nice.

635
00:32:29,160 --> 00:32:31,960
毕竟人家平时开的可是进取号。
Well, he's used to
driving the Enterprise.

636
00:32:32,000 --> 00:32:33,760
没毛病，
他直接飚出了曲速！
That's right,
he went warp speed!

637
00:32:33,800 --> 00:32:36,160
是啊，他一上车来句“照我说的办”，
一切就全搞定了。
Yeah, he got in there
and he said, "Make it so,"
and it all happened.

638
00:32:36,200 --> 00:32:38,160
一点没错。
当然，你可没那特异功能。
Yeah, exactly.
You, of course,
didn't have that.

639
00:32:38,200 --> 00:32:41,040
是啊。所以嘛，只要能排在
帕特里克·斯图尔特
Yeah. So, well, hopefully
somewhere between
Patrick Stewart

640
00:32:41,080 --> 00:32:43,960
和哈里·恩菲尔德之间，
我就能心满意足地离开了。
and Harry Enfield,
I'd walk away here
a happy man.

641
00:32:44,000 --> 00:32:46,240
好吧，你可以高高兴兴地走人了，
因为你的成绩是——
Well, you're going to
walk away a happy man
because you did it in

642
00:32:46,280 --> 00:32:50,080
1分51秒4！
one minute, 51.4 seconds!

643
00:32:50,560 --> 00:32:52,000
这意味着……
Which means...

644
00:32:55,840 --> 00:32:57,280
你排在这儿。
You're there.

645
00:33:02,560 --> 00:33:04,960
-我想如果没说错的话……
-怎么讲？
-I think
I'm right in saying...
-What's that?

646
00:33:05,000 --> 00:33:09,320
我想如果没说错的话，
你成了咱们节目有史以来
跑得最快的美国人！
I think I'm right in saying
you are therefore the fastest
American we've ever had.

647
00:33:09,360 --> 00:33:12,040
-嘿，这纪录相当棒啊！
-确实。
-Hey, that's a good record!
-You are.

648
00:33:15,600 --> 00:33:17,440
哇哦。
Wow.

649
00:33:17,480 --> 00:33:21,640
当然了，
你也是咱们节目有史以来
请过的唯一一个美国人。
You are, of course,
the only American
we've ever had.

650
00:33:21,680 --> 00:33:23,920
-你榜上不还有别人吗？
-上面确实有个大卫·索尔……
-What have you got?
-You've got David Soul
up there...

651
00:33:23,960 --> 00:33:25,720
大卫·索尔？
那家伙菜得抠脚！
David Soul,
he was useless!

652
00:33:25,760 --> 00:33:27,160
菜得抠脚是吧？我的天！
Useless, was he? Oh, God!

653
00:33:27,200 --> 00:33:29,440
还有莱昂纳尔·里奇，他在……
And Lionel Richie, who is...

654
00:33:29,480 --> 00:33:33,400
莱昂纳尔·里奇跑哪儿去了？
我当时随手写成“Rich T”饼干，
因为我不会拼他的全名。
Where is Lionel Richie?
I called him Rich T 'cause
I couldn't spell his name.

655
00:33:33,440 --> 00:33:35,560
噢，等等，不对。
